{"id":"65cecff06a8bc84e","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-min-operator.md","title":"Minimization Operator","display":"df-min-operator — Minimization Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-min-operator","aliases":["90-df-min-operator","90-df-min"],"display":"df-min-operator — Minimization Operator","depends_on":["[[90-df-omega]]","[[90-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-min-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-min-operator</span><span>90-df-min</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-min-operator — Minimization Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是全函数；自然数及次序见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a>，部分函数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu g\">\\(\\mu g\\)</span> 是由下式图引入的部分函数；点值记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu y\\,(g(\\vec x,y)=0)\">\\(\\mu y\\,(g(\\vec x,y)=0)\\)</span> 仅在所列定义域内使用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mu g&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\ng(\\vec x,y)=0\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathbb N\\ (z&lt;y\\Longrightarrow g(\\vec x,z)\\ne0)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu g)&amp;=\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k:\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\ g(\\vec x,y)=0\\},\\\\\n\\mu g&amp;:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\mu y\\,(g(\\vec x,y)=0)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mu g)(\\vec x)\n\\qquad(\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu g)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mu g&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\ng(\\vec x,y)=0\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathbb N\\ (z&lt;y\\Longrightarrow g(\\vec x,z)\\ne0)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu g)&amp;=\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k:\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\ g(\\vec x,y)=0\\},\\\\\n\\mu g&amp;:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\mu y\\,(g(\\vec x,y)=0)&amp;\\coloneqq(\\mu g)(\\vec x)\n\\qquad(\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu g)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原来的全函数实参条件。若不存在零点则该输入不在部分函数图中；不把发散号当作函数值。此处不是允许前面搜索位置发散的部分函数最小化约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$g:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\mathbb N$ 是全函数；自然数及次序见 [[90-df-omega]]，部分函数见 [[90-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$g:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\mathbb N$ 是全函数；自然数及次序见 [[90-df-omega]]，部分函数见 [[90-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu y\\,(g(\\vec x,y)=0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mu g&\\coloneqq\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\ng(\\vec x,y)=0\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathbb N\\ (z<y\\Longrightarrow g(\\vec x,z)\\ne0)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu g)&=\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k:\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\ g(\\vec x,y)=0\\},\\\\\n\\mu g&:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\mu y\\,(g(\\vec x,y)=0)&\\coloneqq(\\mu g)(\\vec x)\n\\qquad(\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu g)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1259,"backlinks":[{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-min-operator]]、[[90-df-min-operator-generalized]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]